Package: retro-boomer-gui
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: Retro Boomer <aquacongass@proton.me>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libgcc-s1, xdg-desktop-portal
Homepage: https://retroboomer.org
Description: Native Retro Boomer wallet
 Retro Boomer wallet with its private, locally supervised full node.
 Wallet data remains in the user's home directory when the package is removed.
